Printed←{
   ⍝ Footer with generation timestamp ⍺ (as ⎕TS)
   ⍝ As in the book, the day name is the observation's (#22)
    h←12|⍺[4] ⋄ h←h+12×h=0
    ap←(1+⍺[4]<12)⊃'PM' 'AM'
    mn←¯2↑'0',⍕⌊⍺[5]
    '' ('GENERATED ',(DayName ⍵.StatedDayNo),' ',(⍕⍺[1]),'/',(⍕⍺[2]),'/',(⍕⍺[3]),' AT ',(⍕⌊h),':',mn,' ',ap) }
